  nombre: Jack Wolfgang
  type: 1
  dialogos:
  - "\u201CNothing against anyone, but some guests don\u2019t enjoy my\u2026 nightly
    energy.\u201D"
  - "\u201CAnyone with a strong smell nearby? Makes me uneasy.\u201D"
  - "\u201CI\u2019ll try not to howl\u2026 too much.\u201D"
  - "\u201CHigher floors mean fewer complaints\u2026 I think.\u201D"
  dialogosPuzzleExito:
  - "\u201CPerfect! No one will hear a thing tonight.\u201D"
  dialogosPuzzleFallo:
  - "\u201CSomeone\u2019s going to complain, and it won\u2019t be me.\u201D"
